{:strongs 3120, :hebrew "יון", :lang :zh-Hans, :gloss "Javan, the name of a son of Joktan, and of the race (Ionians, i.e. Greeks) descended from him, with their territory; also of a place in Arabia", :text "雅完，约坍之子的名字，亦指由其后裔繁衍的族裔（伊奥尼亚人，即希腊人）及其领地；亦指阿拉伯的一个地名。", :model "glm-5.2", :timestamp "2026-07-27T02:21:58.748218562Z"}